WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.800
But those are still pretty limited.

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:04.600
And as your business gets more complicated

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.533
and you have more and more projects,

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:08.100
it can start to get a little

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:10.467
bit harder to kind of keep track.

00:00:10.467 --> 00:00:13.600
That's why these agents have started to

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.833
really emerge where you're starting to interact

00:00:15.833 --> 00:00:17.867
with these agents one on one,

00:00:17.933 --> 00:00:19.333
almost like a chief of staff.
